        "code": {
          "text": "Abdominal pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "36–48 hours of pain, initially vague periumbilical discomfort and now localised to the right iliac fossa/right lower quadrant; constant ache with sharp twinges on movement or coughing. Pain 7/10 on movement today and approximately 4/10 yesterday. Worse with walking, coughing and speed bumps."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
